Changes made for squeezeVPN:
- tools/libwg-go/mark/ (new): marks connections of apps whose traffic the server leaves untouched
  (source 10.8.0.2 -> 10.8.0.3, replies back), asking the app once per new connection.
- tools/libwg-go/api-android.go: wraps the tun device with mark.New; plainFlow() calls into jni.c.
- tools/libwg-go/jni.c: JNI_OnLoad keeps the JavaVM; svpn_plain() calls GoBackend.plainFlow().
- tools/libwg-go/Makefile: rebuilds when the Go/C sources change, not only go.mod.
- GoBackend.java: setUidFilter() / UidFilter, plainFlow() (ConnectivityManager.getConnectionOwnerUid).
- Removed: WgQuickBackend, RootShell, ToolsInstaller, libwg.so / libwg-quick.so (root only),
  tests, publishing and signing; build.gradle.kts and tools/CMakeLists.txt rewritten for this project.
